      "description": "<p>hello everyone</p>\n<p>i think some of you know the quotes because i post it before at 3.11.4 and 2.8k people download it so i add it in addons ;) this is some of the Quotes that i gather it up from a website : <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://callofduty.fandom.com/wiki/Quoted_sayings_in_the_Call_of_Duty_series\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://callofduty.fandom.com/wiki/Quoted_sayings_in_the_Call_of_Duty_series</a></p>\n<p>total quotes : 352 quotes</p>\n<p>i put it all in a JSON file and make it fit that every time you die you will get a cool Quote.</p>\n<p>be advised this will work only if you install this mod -&gt; Headshot Darkness</p>\n<p>example:</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://media0.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExanhubXI2czMwc2c4am05NWU4MWhqNGt5c2E1MWpsYWdhbDdrcDRuZiZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/TDUNL6DR3g1fvrf1H7/giphy.gif\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://media0.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExanhubXI2czMwc2c4am05NWU4MWhqNGt5c2E1MWpsYWdhbDdrcDRuZiZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/TDUNL6DR3g1fvrf1H7/giphy.gif</a></p>\n<p>install the JSON file:</p>\n<p>simply go to BepInEx\\plugins\\HeadshotDarkness then drop the File there</p>\n<p>settings: ( you can change it if you want )</p>\n<p>keep the death text and contextual death enable\ni will make sure in the future i will put 2 files to the old one and the new one in the future so you guys can choose what you like ;)</p>\n<p>until next time….have a great raids ^-^</p>\n",
